{"4089250": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Xeno Rescue", "steam_appid": 4089250, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Xeno Rescue</strong> immerses you in a desperate mission deep within a remote research station. Inspired by the legendary Alien 3 for Mega Drive / Genesis and Super Nintendo, it combines fast-paced action, suspense, and a dark, tension-filled atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assuming the role of Erika, a government executive from Earth, you must navigate the different levels of the laboratory to rescue trapped scientists while trying to survive the horror lurking in the shadows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level is a race against time where every bullet, every second, and every decision counts.Uncover the truth and face alien creatures and security androids in a fight for survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the incredible abilities of the quantum glove to uncover secrets and survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Phase Shift: Use the quantum shift ability to unveil new paths and discover secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >                        </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >                         <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4089250/extras/6908ecfd199aa66cd75459217df9118b.poster.avif?t=1771720819\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4089250/extras/6908ecfd199aa66cd75459217df9118b.webm?t=1771720819\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4089250/extras/6908ecfd199aa66cd75459217df9118b.mp4?t=1771720819\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >                         </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Regeneration: Restores a small amount of health to recover from bloody battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >                       <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4089250/extras/8bf4ab6db96c43e9ed1f931332781025.poster.avif?t=1771720819\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4089250/extras/8bf4ab6db96c43e9ed1f931332781025.webm?t=1771720819\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4089250/extras/8bf4ab6db96c43e9ed1f931332781025.mp4?t=1771720819\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weapon Enhancer: Infuse your weapons with an energy overload to make them stronger for a short period of time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >                       <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4089250/extras/6062f82ba37ac6bbc223639cd89880a3.poster.avif?t=1771720819\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4089250/extras/6062f82ba37ac6bbc223639cd89880a3.webm?t=1771720819\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4089250/extras/6062f82ba37ac6bbc223639cd89880a3.mp4?t=1771720819\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>                      </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slow: Slow down enemies to be able to face them and increase your chances of survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >                        </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >                      <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4089250/extras/2723f443c1efa67075fc7efd2c1afeb4.poster.avif?t=1771720819\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4089250/extras/2723f443c1efa67075fc7efd2c1afeb4.webm?t=1771720819\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4089250/extras/2723f443c1efa67075fc7efd2c1afeb4.mp4?t=1771720819\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Main Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story Mode - Experience the single-player campaign across 15 dangerous levels. Explore every corner in search of secrets without the pressure of time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic Mode - Play Xeno Rescue as it was originally conceived, with the constant pressure of time at your heels, you won't be able to stop to admire the scenery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hardcore Mode - Do you have what it takes to beat Xeno Rescue with a limited number of lives?</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Xeno Rescue</strong> immerses you in a desperate mission deep within a remote research station. Inspired by the legendary Alien 3 for Mega Drive / Genesis and Super Nintendo, it combines fast-paced action, suspense, and a dark, tension-filled atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assuming the role of Erika, a government executive from Earth, you must navigate the different levels of the laboratory to rescue trapped scientists while trying to survive the horror lurking in the shadows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level is a race against time where every bullet, every second, and every decision counts.Uncov